<title>UK: Campbell &amp; Armstrong makes loss in year.</title>
<headline>Campbell &amp; Armstrong makes loss in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>thirteen months to January 31</p>
<p>				    (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr loss (pence)	 54.6		   vs 1.4 gain</p>
<p> Adjusted shr loss	32.1		   vs 1.4 gain</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax loss		7.98		   vs 0.2 profit</p>
<p> Turnover		   72.29		  vs 60.74</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparisons are for year to December 31. Shopfitting group Campbell &amp; Armstrong Plc said it was restructuring the firm to reduce gearing and strengthen the balance sheet.</p>
</text>
